      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 64.78,
      "end": 71.76,
      "text": "I pull that lever, I run for the jaw, but the thing in the walls wants a little bit more.",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 72.0,
      "end": 77.16,
      "text": "The Bunker has teeth, and I cannot sleep.",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 94.68,
      "end": 101.98,
      "text": "found an old soldier curled by the well his empty eyes had a story to tell",
      "uncertain": true
    },
    {
      "start": 101.98,
      "end": 109.06,
      "text": "a note said save him a note said flee a gun in the drawer and a key for the sea",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 109.06,
      "end": 116.36,
      "text": "i dragged my boots through a flooded hall hear that beast scrape across the wall",
      "uncertain": true
    },
    {
      "start": 116.36,
      "end": 120.0,
      "text": "One wrong noise and the whole place wakes",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 120.0,
      "end": 125.06,
      "text": "I am feeding fear with every step I take",
      "uncertain": true
    },
    {
      "start": 131.12,
      "end": 134.3,
      "text": "No, no, no, keep the generator alive",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 134.3,
      "end": 138.12,
      "text": "No, no, no, just give me one more try",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 138.12,
      "end": 141.72,
      "text": "Smoke in my lungs, blood on the floor",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 141.72,
      "end": 146.4,
      "text": "I AM NOT DYING IN THIS DAMN DULL WAR",
      "uncertain": true
    },
    {
      "start": 160.72,
      "end": 164.38,
      "text": "The bunker has teeth, the bunker has breath",
      "uncertain": true
    },
    {
